### Code generation

This stack uses `build_runner` (Firebase, JSON Serializable, freezed, Retrofit, etc.):

```bash
dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
```

Re-run after changing generated routes, MobX stores, Hive adapters, or JSON-serializable/freezed annotated classes.

```bash
flutter pub run easy_localization:generate -S assets/translations -O lib/src/core/i18n -o locale_keys.g.dart
```

